WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.770
So you've come, Kaito.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:11.190
Chris... No, V!

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.230
Why?! How could you?!

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:26.790
What's the deal?

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.390
They haven't been broadcasting the Duels this whole time.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.050
Is Yuma okay?

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.620
Something isn't right.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.630
Kaito-<i>sama</i>! I can't stay put any longer!

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.180
Even if he turns me into scrap, I will stay by Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s side!

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.880
I am his humble tool!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.020
Where the heck are we even riding to?!

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.650
Geez, slow down a little!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.030
But I gotta hurry and find someone who can fight me in the one-on-one Duels!

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:01.890
That may be true, but even
 if you blindly ride through the darkness...

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.940
What do you think's gonna happen
 if you fall into another Trap again?!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.750
What?!

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.170
Did someone fall into a Trap?!

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.250
Humble tool...

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.830
Orbital?!

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.350
Oh~! You're the source of humbleness!

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.930
A-Are you okay? You're not broken, are you?

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.060
Huh?

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.830
Yikes! You're that dreadful scrap woman!

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.070
Gosh, I'm gonna throw you off!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.900
Gah! Hold on a minute!

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:36.040
I have to hurry to Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s side!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:37.790
You're going to Kaito?

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:46.540
That's right... I have something I need to tell him.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:48.630
Orbital! Show me the way!

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.380
U-Understood!

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:07.390
Kaito...

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.860
I always knew the day would 
come where we would fight each other.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.450
On that day I learned the truth...

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:25.860
I was consumed by feelings of hatred and revenge.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.000
Ever since that day...!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.470
You hurt Haruto.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.730
I'll make you regret doing that! Here I come!

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.640
Duel!!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:51.680
I'll take the first turn. My turn! Draw!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.370
I Summon Planet Pathfinder!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.470
Then I Special Summon Solar Wind Jammer!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:09.580
This card can be Special Summoned from my hand by halving its Attack Power.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.960
Then I activate the Magic Card, Tannhäuser Gate!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:20.540
This card changes the levels of my two Monsters to the total of their combined levels.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.540
My Monsters are Level Four and Five.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.820
Thus, my two Monsters become Level Nines!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.600
Two Level Nine Monsters...

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:37.450
I Overlay the Level Nine Planet Pathfinder and Solar Wind Jammer!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.770
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.440
Xyz Summon!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:48.400
Show yourself, Number 9!

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:50.630
A Number!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:52.830
What!?

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.790
Sky Canopy Star - Dyson Sphere!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.980
Where is your Number?!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.480
The moment I successfully Xyz Summoned,

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:08.430
because of the effect of the
 Field Magic activated here, Cosmic Frontier,

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.880
I can draw one card!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.650
I set one card face-down and end my turn.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.480
Where is his Monster...?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.080
What's wrong?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.570
It's your turn, Kaito.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.570
My turn! Draw!!

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.980
<i>Even if I can't see what it looks like,</i>

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.160
<i>if he Summoned a Monster...</i>

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.430
I Summon Photon Delta Wing!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.250
Photon Delta Wing, attack his Monster!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.730
Photon Missile!!

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:54.730
What!?

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.710
Unfortunately for you, your attacks won't be able to reach me.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.480
Im-Impossible...!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.740
Are you done now? Then I suppose it's my turn.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:06.990
Draw!!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:12.810
I use Dyson Sphere to attack Photon Delta Wing!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:15.780
What!?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.350
What in the world just happened?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.510
You wouldn't know, would you?

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:40.030
My current Dueling goes far beyond your comprehension.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:48.840
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:54.180
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:11.030
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:16.830
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:21.420
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:27.460
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:32.550
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:38.100
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:43.900
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:48.940
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:54.410
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:06:54.740 --> 00:07:00.080
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:06.250
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:12.340
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.210
Wow, this is amazing! Is this space?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.880
This appears to be the Space Field.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:25.920
"Number 55: Galaxy Eyes Sealed?!
 The Cosmic Class Number Appears!"

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.840
I'll confirm the verification signal on the D-Pad.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.670
It's Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.880
On that space ship!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.760
H-Hold on! You're going too fast!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.850
B-Because this thing won't do what I tell it to!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.320
Geez, you really are an idiot.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.650
Are you harmed, Kaito-<i>sama</i>?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.650
K-Kaito!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.360
You people...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.320
Kaito...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.580
Kaito, I have something I need to tell you.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.290
Tell me?

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.620
Yeah, Droite... During Droite's Duel...!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.840
That Tron jerk took her down!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:13.090
Droite... fought desperately against Tron for your sake!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:13.630
But...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.850
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:19.850
Droite liked y-

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.020
That's none of my concern.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:24.690
You...!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:25.860
How could you...?!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.360
Kaito-<i>sama</i>...?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.200
Damn you, Kaito!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.160
Yuma Tsukumo.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.700
Kazuma-<i>san</i>'s son.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:38.660
You're...

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.330
I didn't think all the actors would gather in one place like this.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.170
This could very well be the act of fate.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.080
I have something I want to ask you.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.170
My dad... Where's my dad?!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.800
Very well. Before this Duel unfolds,

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.840
I shall tell you all that I know.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:00.890
Stop joking around! I don't want to listen to anything you have to say!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.020
Come on, let's continue the Duel already!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:08.060
Kaito, this story is related to you as well.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:14.030
Why do you think our family appeared in this Duel Carnival?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.740
And why do you supposed we went after you siblings?

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:23.040
Why do we seek revenge against your father, Dr. Faker?

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.630
That Dr. Faker is...?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.500
Dr. Faker is Kaito's dad?!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.670
And you guys want revenge against him?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.130
What the heck does he mean?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.760
My dad and Kaito's dad were...?

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:44.350
You'll know the answer once you hear this story.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.890
Five years ago from this date...

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.650
A scientist as well as Kaito's father, Faker,

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:55.360
spent a great amount of time researching a way to open the door to the Parallel Worlds with my father, Byron.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.580
<i>I am observing distortions in the dimensions all over the place.</i>

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.580
<i>And despite that, why can't I specify its location?!</i>

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.210
<i>Why can't I?!</i>

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.170
<i>Faker...</i>

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:14.550
<i>Come drink this and calm your nerve-</i>

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.930
<i>I have no time for that!</i>

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.600
<i>If I don't find the door to the Parallel Worlds soon...!</i>

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.100
<i>Faker...</i>

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.520
<i>That's right.</i>

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.060
<i>There's someone else looking for the door to the Parallel Words other than us...</i>

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.480
<i>Chris, bring up that image.</i>

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:31.980
<i>Yes, Father.</i>

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.780
<i>He's quite the interesting person with considerable talent, you see.</i>

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.490
<i>A man who is an adventurer, Kazuma Tsukumo.</i>

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.670
<i>This is nice. I can take it easy for a while here.</i>

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.960
<i>No one will bother me here.</i>

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:57.670
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.760
<i>Well... Guess not.</i>

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.140
<i>Wow, that's some impressive equipment.</i>

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.020
<i>Welcome.</i>

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.600
<i>I'm grateful that you came all the way here when we called you on such short notice.</i>

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.980
<i>Kazuma Tsukumo.</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.940
<i>I am Byron Arclight. I am in your hands.</i>

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:23.700
<i>A Gravity Charter Electromagnetic Wave Map, huh? That's incredible.</i>

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.580
<i>There is no time for this!</i>

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.700
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.580
<i>I have investigated all the phenomenon that has been occurring!</i>

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.960
<i>But I haven't been able to find anything.</i>

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.460
<i>Something... Something's missing!</i>

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.960
<i>Kazuma, will you give us your opinion on</i>

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.760
<i>all of our research regarding the Parallel Worlds, whether we're right or wrong?</i>

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.470
<i>If we find that door, the history of mankind will be changed.</i>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.730
<i>I bet we'll get more wealth 
and fame than we'd ever think imaginable!</i>

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.940
<i>Wealth and fame...</i>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.270
<i>I have no need for such worthless nonsense!</i>

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.240
<i>I have to find the door to the Parallel Worlds at all costs!</i>

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.700
<i>Hearing that puts my mind at ease.</i>

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.410
<i>Kazuma! You...</i>

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:12.120
<i>The only thing I'm interested in is genuine adventure!</i>

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.420
<i>So you were testing us...</i>

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.040
<i>Look at this.</i>

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.760
<i>If we want the door to the Parallel Worlds to open itself,</i>

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:27.470
<i>we have to observe any unusual behavior within the 21 passage points that are invoked on the map.</i>

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:32.730
<i>If we analyze them, I suspect we will be able to specify where the next door will manifest itself.</i>

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.770
<i>A 21 formulaic equation, huh?</i>

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.110
<i>That's right. The answer has already begun to reveal itself.</i>

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.570
<i>I'm just one step away.</i>

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.490
<i>But that one step is...</i>

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.410
<i>It won't appear.</i>

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:47.780
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.950
<i>Absurd...! All of the observations are...</i>

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.410
<i>The location isn't within 21 passage points.</i>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.040
<i>There are some things you just can't understand in a lab.</i>

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.630
<i>There's still two passage points remaining. In other words, there's 23 points where occurrence is possible.</i>

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.300
<i>I-Is that... really true!?</i>

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:12.060
<i>Yes. The answer is that this is really a 23 formulaic equation.</i>

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:18.520
Thus, we began gathering new information in order to calculate a new formula.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.070
We reached a single conclusion.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.110
And the place we were headed...

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:26.660
...was the location where we believed the next door to the Parallel Worlds would reveal itself.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.290
<i>Well, our adventure begins now.</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.830
<i>You guys will wait here and be on standby.</i>

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.880
<i>It will just be us going from here on out.</i>

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.340
<i>Just the three of us.</i>

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.680
<i>It'll be okay. Don't worry, Chris.</i>

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:48.930
<i>Father...</i>

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.640
I saw nothing beyond this point.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.310
What happened after is what my father told me from his memories...

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.740
Kazuma-<i>san</i> guided the three of them down the mountain toward the bottom of the Earth.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:21.250
<i>Kazuma-</i>san<i>, do you really think we'll be able to get there?</i>

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.380
<i>Our destination is unprecedented territory.</i>

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.760
<i>But that is why there's meaning in taking up the challenge.</i>

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.340
<i> We gotta bring it to 'em.</i>

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:30.760
<i>Bring it to 'em?</i>

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.680
<i>It's the feeling to never give up on a challenge.</i>

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.810
<i>Is that a picture of your family?</i>

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.100
<i>Yes.</i>

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.360
<i>The boy's obsessed with Dueling.</i>

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:47.030
<i>Oho, my family as well.
 We have three sons.</i>

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.990
<i>Faker also has two sons.</i>

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.580
<i>Why is Dr. Faker so concerned with all this?</i>

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.870
<i>I'm not sure, but Faker is a true genius.</i>

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.840
<i>He must be thinking about something.</i>

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.300
<i>As for me, no matter what it takes,</i>

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.340
<i>I want to help him find the door of the Parallel Worlds.</i>

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>Dr. Faker must be happy to have such a good friend like you.</i>

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.560
<i>Good friend, huh?</i>

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:24.730
<i>"When two souls are offered up, the door shall open."</i>

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.570
<i>As I figured.</i>

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.030
Three days after that...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.910
My father and the others finally reached their destination.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.540
<i>Are these some kind of historic ruins?</i>

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.040
<i>Could this be...?!</i>

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.090
<i>It is! I can't be wrong! This is the Parallel World's...</i>

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.140
<i>If that's the case, the door to the Parallel Worlds must be up ahead!</i>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.150
<i>Faker! Kazuma!</i>

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.480
<i>Don't move!</i>

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:11.570
<i>I see. In order to keep out intruders, they've set all sorts of traps in here.</i>

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.200
<i>We haven't even seen the real threats yet.</i>

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.910
<i>Those without wisdom and courage
 shouldn't dare to step foot in here.</i>

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.960
<i>Are you all right, Faker?</i>

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.090
<i>Huh? Yeah.</i>

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.770
<i>It's a dead end.</i>

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.820
<i>Strange. There has to be something here.</i>

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:52.650
<i>That's...</i>

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:55.320
<i>What?!</i>

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.120
<i>This moment has come at last!</i>

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:01.500
<i>Faker!</i>

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.120
<i>I hold no hatred toward either of you.</i>

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.290
<i>What the hell are you doing!?</i>

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.250
<i>There is something written on the ground below your feet.</i>

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:15.760
<i>It says, "When two souls are offered up, the door shall open."</i>

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.970
<i>You don't... intend to sacrifice us!?</i>

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:21.270
<i>Faker!</i>

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:25.560
<i>I must find the door to the Parallel Worlds no matter what!</i>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:30.400
<i>Dr. Faker! Wasn't Byron your close friend!?</i>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.110
<i>Close friend? What nonsense.</i>

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.950
<i>If you call yourself my close friend,</i>

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.330
<i>you should be delighted to become my sacrifice!</i>

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:44.540
<i>Byron!</i>

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.790
<i>Faker!</i>

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.920
<i>After all, mediocre fools like you couldn't possibly understand!</i>

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.260
<i>I'm gonna Bring it to 'em!</i>

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:08.650
<i>Kazuma... Kazuma, let go of my hand!
 If you don't, you'll also...!</i>

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.110
<i>It's a bit inappropriate and childish for this situation,</i>

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:15.110
<i>but people say if you Duel, you're sure to make friends.</i>

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>Dueling and adventuring is the same to me!</i>

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.490
<i>If you adventure together with others, you'll all become friends!</i>

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.070
<i>Kazuma...</i>

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.120
<i>I won't ever give up!</i>

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.380
<i>Now disappear from my sight!</i>

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.380
<i>I'll never forget this grudge, Faker!</i>

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.060
So that's how my dad met his end...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.640
<i>"If you offer up two souls, a new door shall be opened."</i>

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.980
<i>This is... Xyz Summoning!</i>

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.650
But my father came back.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:19:00.070
<i>While wandering the threshold in the Parallel Worlds, he fed off his own thoughts for revenge.</i>

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.870
<i>However, his appearance began
 to change greatly as compensation.</i>

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.910
<i>Into the form you see now of my father, Tron!</i>

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.460
Wh-What'd you just say!?

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.090
Tron... <i>That same</i> Tron is III and V's dad!?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.600
And the one responsible for all of this is Dr. Faker!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.560
I will have retribution at all costs!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.770
I live only for Haruto.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:29.850
Kaito...

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:34.560
I have no interest in what he... Dr. Faker has done.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.030
We're continuing the Duel! Move, Yuma!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.160
My turn! Draw!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.080
I Special Summon Photon Thrasher!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:50.830
This card can be Special Summoned
 when I have no Monsters on the field!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:54.420
Then I Normal Summon Photon Pirate!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:03.340
Photon Pirate can Banish one Photon Monster in my Graveyard in order to raise this card's Attack Power by 1000 during this turn!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:10.060
He has two Monsters with over 2000 Attack Power on the field.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.520
Kaito's about to play his trump card!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.730
I release Photon Thrasher and Photon Pirate!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.570
Darkness within the shining galaxy...

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.280
Become the light of hope and live as my servant!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.620
The Embodiment of Light will now descend!

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.540
Appear before us! Galaxy Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.590
So you've appeared, Galaxy Eyes...

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:45.510
<i>In the last turn, my 1800 Attack Power Delta Wing was destroyed and I received 1000 points of damage...</i>

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.180
<i>In other words, the invisible enemy has 2800 Attack Points.</i>

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:56.310
Then I'll demolish it using the 3000 Attack Power Galaxy Eyes!

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.650
How foolish.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.740
Go! Photon Stream of Destruction!!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.240
What!?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:15.170
Very well, Kaito. I will show you my Number!

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.880
What in the world is this?!

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.230
Wh-What the heck?!

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.820
It's ridiculously huge!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:49.370
Impossible!

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:59.710
A Monster so very large that it enshrouds the very sun itself.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.210
Sky Canopy Star - Dyson Sphere!

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.930
No other Monster can even hope to defeat it.

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:15.520
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:21.150
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.370
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.080
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:53.260
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.890
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:05.400
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:10.860
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:21.750
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:26.960
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:43.270
V's Number is Dyson Sphere!

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:46.900
Its ability protects it from all attacks.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.690
It's truly an invincible Monster!

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:51.610
You're kidding! Kaito's going to lose?!

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:54.200
He's read through every one of his attacks?!

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.160
Kaito... You're my friend!

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:58.500
You have a purpose!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.620
I won't allow you if you lose!

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.250
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:06.800
"The Great Decisive Battle of Outer Space!
 Neo Galaxy-Eyes Strikes Back"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.010
What <i>is</i> that card?!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.510
Today we're introducing Number 9: Dyson Sphere!

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:15.550
How big it is!

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.010
I won't lose to its size!

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:18.890
In the bathroom, I can make something <i>way</i> bigger-

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:22.190
What are you saying when people are eating dinner?!

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:23.100
I apologize...
